\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Abasa 80:3 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"To, me ya sanar da kai cẽwa watakila shi ne zai tsarkaka.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/80.html\">Sura Abasa</a> › Aya 3</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Abasa 80:3</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُ يَزَّكَّىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">To, me ya sanar da kai cẽwa watakila shi ne zai tsarkaka.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالتزكية وإن كان أصلها النماء والبركة وزيادة الخير فإنما تحصل بإزالة الشر؛ فلهذا صار التزكي يجمع هذا وهذا.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 10/97</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s80a3\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/ha/ayah/80-13.html\">Aya ta gaba (80:13)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/80-13.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Abasa 80:13 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"(Tunãtarwa ce) ta cikin littafai abãban girmamãwa,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/80-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alt